// WCTO extensions
// Status: To be developed only where existing FHIR R4, NZ Base, SDC, or
// approved Health New Zealand extensions cannot represent the requirement.
//
// Candidate needs for assessment include:
// - business status
// - form-component linkage
// - response lineage
// - contribution metadata
// - summary audience
//
// Every extension requires an approved definition, context, cardinality,
// datatype, invariants, and governance owner.
